To answer your questions:

Historical Depth: The daily net foreign inflow data currently spans from the beginning of 2025. We are actively working on extending this historical depth.

Market-Wide Aggregate: There isn't a single endpoint for market-wide aggregate flow right now, so you would need to sum the tickers manually. However, a market-wide endpoint is something we are considering adding in the near future.

EOD Availability: You should schedule your pipeline to run around 20:00 WIB to ensure all EOD data is fully finalized.

Credit Cost: Yes, the 1-credit cost applies regardless of the date range; a 90-day pull still costs just 1 credit.

Rate Limits: The Insider tier has a rate limit of 300 requests per minute.

